<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Email Demo</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <h1 style="color: #f26b4f;">Demo Email</h1>
    <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
    <p>{{message}}</p>
    <p>This is a demonstration of the Primus Notification module's email capabilities.</p>
    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 20px 0;">
    <p style="color: #666; font-size: 12px;">Sent to: {{email}}</p>
</body>
</html>
